Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `load` uses the effect `FS.Read("secret.txt")`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effect_scope_need_outside_row.jet:5:14
    |
  5 | load: fn() -[FS.Read("assets/")]> String {
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[FS.Read("assets/")]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read("secret.txt")` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read("secret.txt")` to the effect list, or stop using it in `load`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: load
